@startuml
title Tic Tac Toe - State Machine

[*] --> IN_PROGRESS : createInitialState(players)

IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : handleAction(TicTacToePlayerAction)\n[validateMove() == true,\nisGameOver() == false]\n/ currentPlayer switches (X ↔ O)\n/ moveCount++

IN_PROGRESS --> P1_WIN : handleAction(TicTacToePlayerAction)\n[isGameOver() == true,\n3 in a row detected]

IN_PROGRESS --> P2_WIN : handleAction(TicTacToePlayerAction)\n[isGameOver() == true,\n3 in a row detected]

IN_PROGRESS --> TIE : handleAction(TicTacToePlayerAction)\n[isGameOver() == true,\nmoveCount == 9, no winner]

note right of IN_PROGRESS
  handleAction() is rejected if
  validateMove() returns false.
  A ValidationResult { valid: false }
  is produced with failureReason
  and validActions.
end note

P1_WIN --> [*]
P2_WIN --> [*]
TIE --> [*]

@enduml
